I can't see any reason you would kick a throne when you could sit on it
instead. For more information, see the Thrones spoiler:

http://www.steelypips.org/nethack/343/thrn-343.html

The short reason is "The things you can get from sitting on the throne
are _way cooler._" You should be sure to be strong enough to handle the
bad effects, but it sounds like you were.

Also, I would have kept the Minetown priest a lot longer to be able to
make donations for protection, but you got crowned out of the deal,
so maybe it wasn't such a bad choice --- although, as you saw, being
crowned does have a significant impact on your prayer timeout. :) 
Even prayer would only have brought your hit points back to maximum 
once, though; I would have been hoping for a scroll or wand of teleport
in your position, I think, not just some more hit points. 

Oh, and I would have picked up some armor, any armor, and worn it,
if you didn't (I'm sure one of the watchmen had something useful),
but maybe you did that and just didn't mention it, or I missed it.

